    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## New Customer Welcome Sequence\nSends every new customer a 3-email welcome series over a week: a warm welcome, helpful tips, then a thank-you offer and review request.\n\n### Setup\n1. Fill in **Config**: business name, emails, website, discount code and review link.\n2. Pick your **SMTP** credential on all three email nodes.\n3. Edit the wording of the three emails (especially the tips in *Email 2*).\n4. Activate, copy the **Production URL** from *New Customer Webhook*.\n5. Have your tool send a POST with at least `email` (and ideally `first_name` or `name`) to that URL. Shopify, WooCommerce, Square, Calendly, Typeform, Jotform etc. all support webhooks.\n\nFull guide: README.md in this workflow's folder.",
        "height": 480,
        "width": 500,
        "color": 7
      },
